     "Sphenomorphus cranei, also known commonly as Crane's skink and Crane's forest skink, is a species of lizard in the family Scincidae. The species is endemic to the Solomon Islands."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Etymology",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
